{"id":"bcb978a14a477f5c","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-order-complexity.md","title":"阶复杂性与自复杂性","display":"df-order-complexity — 阶复杂性与自复杂性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-order-complexity","aliases":["43-df-order-complexity"],"display":"df-order-complexity — 阶复杂性与自复杂性","depends_on":["[[43-df-kolm]]","[[43-df-order-function]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_location":"Definition 11.11.1 (Kjos-Hanssen–Merkle–Stephan)","source_printed_pages":"274","source_pdf_pages":"294","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-round3"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-order-complexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-order-complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-order-complexity — 阶复杂性与自复杂性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9919dea7144eefd8\" href=\"?note=9919dea7144eefd8\" title=\"43-df-order-function\">43-df-order-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Definition 11.11.1 (Kjos-Hanssen–Merkle–Stephan)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"274"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"294"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-round3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,A\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X,A\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 总定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Order}\">\\(\\operatorname{Order}\\)</span>、函数归约 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_T\">\\(\\le_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9919dea7144eefd8\" href=\"?note=9919dea7144eefd8\" title=\"43-df-order-function\">43-df-order-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>。下式引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OracleOrder}(g,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{OracleOrder}(g,A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OrderComplex}(X)\">\\(\\operatorname{OrderComplex}(X)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Autocomplex}(X)\">\\(\\operatorname{Autocomplex}(X)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OracleOrder}(g,A)\\iff g\\le_TA\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;g(n)\\le g(n+1)\\land\\forall b\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;g(n)&gt;b.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{OracleOrder}(g,A)\\iff g\\le_TA\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;g(n)\\le g(n+1)\\land\\forall b\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;g(n)&gt;b.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OrderComplex}(X)\\iff\\exists g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;(\\operatorname{Order}(g)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;C(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge g(n)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{OrderComplex}(X)\\iff\\exists g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;(\\operatorname{Order}(g)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;C(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge g(n)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Autocomplex}(X)\\iff\\exists g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;(\\operatorname{OracleOrder}(g,X)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;C(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge g(n)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Autocomplex}(X)\\iff\\exists g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;(\\operatorname{OracleOrder}(g,X)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;C(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge g(n)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>自复杂性的阶允许由X计算，不能误用仅含无oracle可计算性的Order而让两个概念坍缩。书稿阶复杂性一处写严格大于，采用非严格界以兼容空串以及任意固定最优机器；有限初始值调整不改变无界阶的实质。未把一般自复杂性误写成存在可计算复杂度下界。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所供2007-07-28草稿，Definition 11.11.1 (Kjos-Hanssen–Merkle–Stephan)；印刷页274，PDF页294。本轮逐项核对来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-order-function","status":"resolved","id":"9919dea7144eefd8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-order-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,A\\in2^\\omega$，$g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 总定义；$C$、$\\operatorname{Order}$、函数归约 $\\le_T$ 见 [[43-df-kolm]]、[[43-df-order-function]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。下式引入 $\\operatorname{OracleOrder}(g,A)$、$\\operatorname{OrderComplex}(X)$、$\\operatorname{Autocomplex}(X)$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-order-function","status":"resolved","id":"9919dea7144eefd8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,A\\in2^\\omega$，$g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 总定义；$C$、$\\operatorname{Order}$、函数归约 $\\le_T$ 见 [[43-df-kolm]]、[[43-df-order-function]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。下式引入 $\\operatorname{OracleOrder}(g,A)$、$\\operatorname{OrderComplex}(X)$、$\\operatorname{Autocomplex}(X)$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,A\\in2^\\omega$，$g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 总定义；$C$、$\\operatorname{Order}$、函数归约 $\\le_T$ 见 [[43-df-kolm]]、[[43-df-order-function]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。下式引入 $\\operatorname{OracleOrder}(g,A)$、$\\operatorname{OrderComplex}(X)$、$\\operatorname{Autocomplex}(X)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X,A\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Order}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OracleOrder}(g,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OrderComplex}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Autocomplex}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OracleOrder}(g,A)\\iff g\\le_TA\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;g(n)\\le g(n+1)\\land\\forall b\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;g(n)>b.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OrderComplex}(X)\\iff\\exists g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;(\\operatorname{Order}(g)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;C(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge g(n)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Autocomplex}(X)\\iff\\exists g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;(\\operatorname{OracleOrder}(g,X)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;C(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge g(n)).","display":true}],"bytes":2118,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-279","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-order-complexity]] — 阶复杂性与自复杂性"},{"id":"8a46f83845d36b9e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{Autocomplex}$、$\\operatorname{DNC}$、函数归约 $\\le_T$ 见 [[43-df-order-complexity]]、[[43-df-dnc]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。"},{"id":"d74cf642b5d1413a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{OrderComplex}$、$\\operatorname{DNC}$、$\\Phi_e^X,u_e^X$、$\\operatorname{Computable}$ 见 [[43-df-order-complexity]]、[[43-df-dnc]]、[[43-df-oracle-computation]]、[[43-df-computable]]。所量化 $f,b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 均总定义。"}],"outgoing":["a0589ee7a1cc12e8","9919dea7144eefd8","0784d1de3a88cd94"]}